              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwana wa mũndũ mũka Mũisilaeli, ũla ĩthe wake waĩ Mũmisili, aenda ananĩ ma Isilaeli; na mwana ũsu wa mũndũ mũka Mũisilaeli na mũndũ mũũme wa Isilaeli mokitĩa mwakonĩ wa maeema: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mwana ũsu wa mũndũ mũka Mũisilaeli ayĩuma yĩla Syĩtwa, na kũumanĩa; na mamũete vala ve Mose. Syĩtwa ya inyia wake eetawa Selomithi, mwĩĩtu wa Ndivili, wa mbaĩ ya Ndani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
